Battery clock font

res/font/battery_clock.otf is derived from the Zero through Nine paths in
BatteryGlyph.kt, Copyright (C) 2025 The Android Open Source Project, Apache-2.0.
The conversion preserves the battery digit design with lighter strokes and
adds a matching colon and whitespace for clocks. Its height is normalized
after the inward outline offset.
The original paths and reproducible generator are under tools/.

